<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div class="logo">P</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:#666">Private practice in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach Out</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="lead">
      <div class="panel reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="focus-hero">
        <h1 id="focus-hero">Focus Areas and short programs</h1>
        <p class="muted">I work with adults seeking practical ways to navigate transitions, relationships, and recurring stress. Below are common areas people bring. If something fits, we can design a short, guided engagement to suit your timeframe.</p>

        <div class="card reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="area-1">
          <h3 id="area-1">Transitions & change</h3>
          <p class="muted">Moving through job changes, relocations, or life milestones with attention to values and coping strategies that stick.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="area-2">
          <h3 id="area-2">Anxiety and overwhelm</h3>
          <p class="muted">Skills for steadying attention, interrupting the worry loop, and creating manageable routines.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="area-3">
          <h3 id="area-3">Relationship patterns</h3>
          <p class="muted">Exploring communication, boundaries, and recurrent dynamics that feel stuck or painful.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="mini-program">
          <h3 id="mini-program">Tailored short engagements</h3>
          <p class="muted">We can build a focused series — typically 3–6 sessions — centered on a specific goal: making a decision, stabilizing routines, or preparing for a change. These are structured, collaborative, and practical.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside class="aside reveal-on-scroll">
        <h3>How to choose</h3>
        <p class="muted">If you want time-limited work, tell me when you book. We’ll co-design the scope and review progress so you leave with clear next steps and resources.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--earth);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;color:#666;font-size:13px">Payment: private-pay. I provide documentation you may submit to insurers.</div>
      </aside>
    </div>

    <section class="reveal-on-scroll" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Short example pathways</h3>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Decision Pathway</strong> — 3 sessions: clarify options, test assumptions, plan next steps.</li>
        <li><strong>Stabilize Pathway</strong> — 4 sessions: routines, sleep, and stress skills to reduce daily overwhelm.</li>
        <li><strong>Relationship Pathway</strong> — 5 sessions: communication practice and boundary planning.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="muted">These are examples, not promises. We adapt to your needs and pace.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="reveal-on-scroll" style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Questions people often ask</h3>
      <details>
        <summary>How long is each session?</summary>
        <p class="muted">Most sessions are 45–55 minutes. Some focused check-ins can be shorter by arrangement.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will this be ongoing therapy?</summary>
        <p class="muted">You choose. Some people prefer a short series; others continue with periodic check-ins. We discuss what fits your goals.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Notes</h3>
      <p class="muted">Confidentiality: Your information is kept private within legal and ethical limits. This practice does not provide emergency services. If you are in crisis, contact emergency services or your local crisis line.</p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script>
    (function(){
      // Reveal logic
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const items = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-on-scroll');
      if(prefersReduced){ items.forEach(i=>i.classList.add('revealed')); return }
      if('IntersectionObserver' in window){
        const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
          entries.forEach(e=>{ if(e.isIntersecting) e.target.classList.add('revealed') });
        },{threshold:0.12});
        items.forEach(i=>io.observe(i));
      } else {
        items.forEach(i=>i.classList.add('revealed'));
      }
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--twig:#5f4636;--sand:#ecd9c6;--leaf:#9fb2a0;--bg:#fffdfb}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;background:var(--bg);color:#2a2a2a}
    header{padding:16px 22px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.04)}
    .nav a{margin-left:12px;color:#2a2a2a;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .hero{padding:22px 24px;max-width:980px;margin:20px auto;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.7),rgba(250,246,241,.9));border-radius:12px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-size:420px}
    h1{color:var(--twig);margin:0}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:0 24px}
    .panel{background:#fff;padding:18px;border-radius:10px}
    .steps{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .step{padding:10px;border-left:4px solid var(--leaf);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fbf9f7);border-radius:8px}
    .reveal-on-scroll{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
    .reveal-on-scroll.revealed{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){ .reveal-on-scroll{transition:none} }
    footer{max-width:980px;margin:26px auto;color:#666;padding:0 24px}
    .cta{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px}
    .btn{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:0;background:var(--twig);color:#fff;font-weight:700}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div style="width:40px;height:40px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--twig),var(--leaf));border-radius:8px;color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700">W</div>
      <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero reveal-on-scroll" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
      <h1 id="approach-title">My approach: practical curiosity and steady presence</h1>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">I combine structured tools with reflective conversation. We work together to name patterns, test small changes, and anchor choices that fit your life.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <button class="btn" id="try-btn">Try a short practice</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <section class="panel reveal-on-scroll">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--twig)">Core elements</h2>
          <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
              <strong>Curiosity</strong>
              <p class="muted">We explore patterns without blame, building clarity about what keeps things stuck.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <strong>Practical work</strong>
              <p class="muted">Skill practice and small experiments are central — tools that are easy to try between sessions.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
              <strong>Values alignment</strong>
              <p class="muted">Choices are weighed against what you want your days to feel like, not just what feels urgent now.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel reveal-on-scroll" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h2 style="color:var(--twig)">Session rhythm</h2>
          <p class="muted">Sessions are collaborative. Typical engagements are flexible: a single focused consultation, a short series for a specific goal, or ongoing meetings by agreement.</p>
          <ol>
            <li>Intake — identify priorities and timeline.</li>
            <li>Work — practice strategies and reflect on what helps.</li>
            <li>Review — evaluate progress and plan aftercare or follow-up.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section class="panel reveal-on-scroll" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h2 style="color:var(--twig)">Boundaries & safety</h2>
          <p class="muted">Confidentiality is respected within legal and ethical limits. This practice is not an emergency or crisis service. If you are in immediate danger, call local emergency services or your regional crisis line.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="panel reveal-on-scroll">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0;color:var(--twig)">Useful to know</h3>
